<!-- Ported from storefront-lamp/theme/templates/partials/intake/field-unsupported.twig. Reached
     only for a type FieldTypes doesn't classify — see Definition.unsupportedTypes()'s doc comment;
     IntakeController blocks submission of a form containing one of these before it ever renders,
     so this partial's own presence on screen is itself the tell something is wrong. -->
<div class="rounded-sm border border-danger bg-danger/5 p-4">
  <p class="text-sm text-danger">This question (<%= f.type %>) cannot be displayed. Please contact us and we will complete it with you.</p>
</div>
